 "Start-up, forbidden, done, uncertainty, approval. A rule that fits none of them is usually two rules.": "cef3f64b20.mp3",
 "A short router links topic files by path. Every rule is two hops away, and the agent reads what the task touches.": "008500b9f7.mp3",
